      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRANSON (1) drew wide and worked before fading last start but was racing well prior, leading to cruise home by 17m at Globe Derby two back. Can take advantage of the ace draw so is a big chance to return to the winners' list. NORMANS GIRL (9) has yet to miss a place this time in. Scored a win at Port Pirie two runs ago before coming from this row for third at her latest appearance at Kapunda. Draws out a little on the second line so  may need luck at some point but if it comes her way she could return to the winners' list. MODSQUAD (6) will be fitter and must be considered after he finished third when resuming at Kapunda a week-and-a-half ago. MEET ME AT THE BEACH NZ (10) recorded a hat trick of wins last month, one of them here, and has been solid since. Respect.",
